SUMMARY:Repair the Future: Point of You and Perfect City
DESCRIPTION:A conversation between the Swedish artists behind Point of Yo
 u\, a participatory performance created in many communities that allows 
 participants to reflect on freedom and social sustainability\, and Lewis
  Center Lecturer in Theater Aaron Landsman\, founder of Perfect City\, a
  multigenerational\, multiracial arts cohort based in New York City. Thi
 s informal and rich conversation explores how theater offers tools to le
 arn one anothers' histories and imagine new ways to be in community. The
  guest will discuss how hand-drawn maps\, theatrical reenactment\, and n
 ew dialogues help communities repair the f\nhttps://www.princeton.edu/ev
 ents/2026/repair-future-point-you-and-perfect-city
