DTSTART:20261028T210000Z
DTEND:20261028T220000Z
SUMMARY:The Future of Investing is Bionic: Discussion with Bridgewater As
 sociates
LOCATION:Lewis Library 120
DESCRIPTION:Join this conversation with Senior Investor Adam Zimbler. Bri
 dgewater is on a mission to help the world's leading institutions solve 
 their toughest investment challenges\, combining human judgment and crea
 tivity with the power of AI. Adam leads work on the impact of artificial
  intelligence on global economies and markets. Join this conversation to
  hear from him on the most important questions he is tracking as an inve
 stor. Will AI deliver on the promise of rapid productivity gains? Are we
  heading toward a data center overbuild? What are the implications of th
 e constant drumbeat of AI safety developments and the prospects for regu
 lation? Join us at the Lewis Library in room 120 on October 28th from 5-
 6 p.m. Food will be provided. RSVP for our talk (https://www.gem.com/for
 m?formID=bfef245d-2db9-4ca0-8449-94ae587e02ea) to let us know you are jo
 ining.\nAudience: Graduate Students\nRegister: https://app.joinhandshake
 .com/edu/events/2017971\nhttps://careerdevelopment.princeton.edu/events/
 future-investing-bionic-discussion-bridgewater-associates
URL:https://careerdevelopment.princeton.edu/events/future-investing-bioni
 c-discussion-bridgewater-associates
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR
